      "title": "Name the consecutive coefficient positions",
      "body": "<p>Write each coefficient as a binomial coefficient with one unknown starting index. Compare each one with its immediate neighbour.</p>",
      "recap": "A binomial coefficient includes the bracket-choice factor, and its index records how many variable terms were chosen.",
      "pitfall": "A three-term ratio gives different ratios for the first pair and the second pair.",
      "pause": "Write both adjacent coefficient-ratio equations.",
